2. MVC WORKFLOW

ALGORITHM MVCWorkflow

BEGIN
    USER sends HTTP request
    RECEIVE request at Web Server

    IDENTIFY requested URL and HTTP method

    SEND request to Controller

    CONTROLLER receives request

    VALIDATE request data

    IF request data is invalid THEN
        SET error message
        SEND request to View
        VIEW generates error response
        RETURN response to USER
        STOP
    END IF

    CONTROLLER calls required Model method

    MODEL receives request from Controller

    MODEL establishes connection with DATABASE

    EXECUTE required database operation

    RETRIEVE data from DATABASE

    PROCESS retrieved data

    CLOSE DATABASE connection

    RETURN processed data to CONTROLLER

    CONTROLLER stores data for View

    SELECT appropriate VIEW

    VIEW receives data from CONTROLLER

    GENERATE dynamic HTML response

    SEND generated response to Web Server

    Web Server sends HTTP response to USER

    USER displays the response

END
